ase\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"235.34214002642008\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"235.34214002642008\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"59.70734513274336,343.34513274336285 100.38805194805195,311.0909090909091 158.67178082191782,272.3013698630137 252.4168,275.2266666666667 338.58136986301366,207.47945205479454 406.8951072961374,89.86266094420603\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 11% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 226 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"59.70734513274336\" cy=\"343.34513274336285\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 12%&amp;#10;It rained 19% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 77 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"100.38805194805195\" cy=\"311.0909090909091\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 28%&amp;#10;It rained 30% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 73 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"158.67178082191782\" cy=\"272.3013698630137\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 55%&amp;#10;It rained 29% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"252.4168\" cy=\"275.2266666666667\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 79%&amp;#10;It rained 48% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 73 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"338.58136986301366\" cy=\"207.47945205479454\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 80% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 233 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"406.8951072961374\" cy=\"89.86266094420603\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(40%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Helsinki the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>winter</b> (0.30) and least in\n<b>spring</b> (0.04).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>218</td><td class='num'>25%</td><td class='num'>0.042</td><td class='num'>16.3%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>42%</td><td class='num'>0.150</td><td class='num'>18.2%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>51%</td><td class='num'>0.247</td><td class='num'>14.7%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>175</td><td class='num'>46%</td><td class='num'>0.297</td><td class='num'>11.7%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":60.16952,"lon":24.93545,"n":757,"n_cities":134,"name":"Helsinki","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.06,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.004823008849557522,"n":226,"obs":0.10619469026548672,"sig":true},{"hi":0.19400000000000034,"lo":0.06,"mean":0.11974025974025973,"n":77,"obs":0.19480519480